<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/20th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">Somaliland campaign (1900–1920)</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1900–1920</span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a> · Also known as Anglo-Somali War, Dervish War</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italian-somaliland">Somaliland</a> campaign was the series of British expeditions from 1900 to 1920 against the Dervish movement of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mohammed-abdullah-hassan">Mohammed Abdullah Hassan</a> in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/horn-of-africa">Horn of Africa</a>. Several British, Ethiopian and Italian expeditions failed to destroy his forces. In 1920 British aircraft, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/camel">camel</a> troops and ground forces bombed and captured the Dervish forts at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/taleh">Taleh</a>, and Hassan died soon after.</p></div>
